Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why is this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.53,0:00:01.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,machine swallowing a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.49,0:00:02.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,concrete wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:02.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's moving the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.99,0:00:03.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,whole wall over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:04.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,by one lane,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:05.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,while traffic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:06.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,keeps flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:07.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,The wall is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:07.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,a chain of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:09.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,concrete blocks, pinned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:09.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,together like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:10.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,bike chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:11.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each block weighs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:12.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,about fifteen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:12.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,hundred pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:13.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Wheels under the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:14.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,machine grab the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,T-shaped top of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:16.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,every block.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:17.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then an S-shaped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,track lifts the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.53,0:00:19.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,chain and slides
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,it sideways,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.67,0:00:21.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,twelve feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:22.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,The blocks drop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:22.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,back down in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:23.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,a new line,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:24.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,still locked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:25.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,In the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:26.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,the busy side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:27.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,gets an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:27.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,extra lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:28.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,At night, it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:29.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,zips back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:30.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:31.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,highway walls change
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:32.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,sides every day.
